From cda47b9284af6dafe9a236020fa44c923a87150a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mason <masond3v@protonmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 10:19:57 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 198/203] d3dx11: Implement shader resource view creation and
 texture saving.

Assetto Corsa imports D3DX11CreateShaderResourceViewFromFileW, a stub that
aborted the game at startup. Custom Shaders Patch saves textures (fake
shadows, previews) with D3DX11SaveTextureToMemory, which returned E_NOTIMPL
and left it a NULL blob. DDS files are written with the DX10 header and every
mip level and layer, as native D3DX11 does.
